{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a9a998db37a980af63018d23795343795ab7fbf5325ea493fb9909557bc32ff", "ja": "（ステージの参考にならないかと、\nサンバカーニバルを観に来たけど……すごい熱気だ！）", "zh": "（我想或许可以当作表演的参考，\n就来看森巴嘉年华了……现场真是活力四射啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "624709c0ae415a839dcbacfac8524eba2e96cf31d0cfffb580e447ec27aa0da6", "ja": "ハーイ、みんな！\nまだまだ元気が足りないヨ～！", "zh": "嗨～大家！\n你们的活力还是不够喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "f289c94c59f5b3524518a7d43e4786b998365f9b1df1925825ed3e778faf4d25", "ja": "ワタシと一緒に、もっともっと盛り上がっていこっ！\nほらほらー♪", "zh": "和我一起继续嗨起来吧！\n来吧来吧──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c0c0e5c9aec2a2b153d05275b2eb4b0bd47a803a158f8a7aefacdb0f983bfa78", "ja": "（あっちの方、ずいぶん盛り上がってるな。\nちょっと行ってみよう）", "zh": "（那边的气氛很热烈呢。\n过去看看吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "d14cfd7c41a7d029076625e04f03e1f9112f61f33fd702d4b6e11afc379f842d", "ja": "イイネ！　みんなのダンスを見てたら、\nワタシも楽しくなってきちゃったヨー！", "zh": "很棒喔！看着大家跳舞，\n我也开心起来了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "f75126f7da6515f2d7b04774423c383f7effaad5b2dad2e05e7010bb9c0a354c", "ja": "カーニバルに負けないヨ～！\nイェーイ！", "zh": "不能输给嘉年华喔～！\n耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "78233f19301df5feec93b610c70ede53b1a315b44047ef3866278faf17e1ae6f", "ja": "（あの女の子……\nお客さんなのに、自分が踊っちゃってるのか）", "zh": "（那个女生……\n明明是观众，自己却跳起舞了啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aafce47349f3a2355e36e4a44da2792102d3e7b18f82a75ca19c21746a8d9b65", "ja": "（けど、なんだかすごく楽しそうだ！\n周りのみんなも、つられて踊り出してる……）", "zh": "（但感觉她非常开心！\n周围的人们也被她影响，纷纷跳起了舞……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "16640ad419c52077e37820a634741692ef7e7a40c575a648798e9a403a1dd4e4", "ja": "ほらほら、そこのお兄さんも！\n一緒にダンス、ダンスだヨ～♪", "zh": "来吧来吧，那边的大哥也来！\n一起跳舞、跳舞吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "80e23a66ad24a0297fc871e454b02b8d540c84c92cc0b2c70b0856fca3682766", "ja": "えっ？\nいや、俺は……！", "zh": "咦？\n不，我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "60b2dd587c428ad5c4977c1feaf10c62d5398006ee8aa877781700e7a550f637", "ja": "ほら、早く早くっ♪\nみんなで一緒に踊ると、すっごく楽しいヨ！", "zh": "来吧，快点快点♪\n大家一起跳舞，就会很开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "ccd7e139bd5c9085ca626db9256db03d9085223de1067a1df144e3f038999040", "ja": "はー、楽しかった！\nみんな、一緒に踊ってくれてありがとネっ♪", "zh": "哈～好开心！\n谢谢大家跟我一起跳舞♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "74f96538e795a4a9b1d151a724a12d2ae429d5e8f59ed34cd209d111a55740b4", "ja": "お兄さんも、ありがとっ！\n楽しかったデショ？", "zh": "这位大哥，也谢谢你啦！\n很好玩对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f1d737d4374b66ea71545c815afb561831a26401354bfee4666402ba25597afd", "ja": "はぁ…はぁ…。どういたしまして。\n俺も久しぶりに体を動かせて、楽しかったよ。", "zh": "呼……呼……不客气。\n我也久违地活动了身体，很开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "51bb07ce67394524ca58bea54afe1760fd96ad89a6b0cf48dc5e5a1b1cda94dc", "ja": "それにしても、君はすごく楽しそうに踊るんだな！\nダンスしてる間、ずっと笑顔だったし。", "zh": "话说回来，你好像跳得非常开心呢！\n你跳舞时一直都面带笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "2aacfe98df8ff2386773544f66b046ce733b8103a5399ebe9e09c1f7910437ea", "ja": "うん！　音楽が聞こえてくると、\n体がウズウズしちゃうノ！", "zh": "嗯！只要听到音乐，\n我就坐不住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "07fc26b5589540eb7895e4ae91d4a86e9ad1dc87b5183ff7c7ad95524bdc94df", "ja": "それでネ、気がついたら、\n自然と体が動いちゃってるんだヨ♪", "zh": "然后啊，回过神来时，\n我就已经自然地动起身体了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6529b883558a225b238b6f11ecef8aa9e0e4ca3afafd2ce49b19d6a4463688ff", "ja": "そうか……\n君にとって、ダンスは天職なのかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n对你来说，跳舞可能是天职呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "3fe89b9aaef86304f82d1a30209bfe97f772714093cdb09a7d0208842f34b866", "ja": "ンー？　難しいコトはわからないケド、\n踊るのは楽しいから大好きだヨ♪", "zh": "嗯～？太复杂的事我不太懂，\n但跳舞很开心，所以我最喜欢跳舞了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "60e52a0e6f33931d69e1d76439817234fb365ed3590e7320de590564d2f82fb7", "ja": "パパンやママン、他のみんなも、\n「エレナと踊るのは楽しい」って言うヨ♪", "zh": "爸爸和妈妈，还有其他人，\n都说「和艾琳娜跳舞很开心」喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f5a3a57dfac4c5622155021a41551983c3e50b65adbcea15362d65b8351b6972", "ja": "（天性のリズム感。そして、周囲の人を引きつける\nこの天真爛漫さ。彼女なら……！）", "zh": "（她天生的节奏感，以及吸引周围人们的\n这份天真烂漫。如果她加入的话……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_1022", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ba731a5b7c563cab01f7cc20abd0e86e3bf5ea09e34e2547e01ab46f0a03b212", "ja": "君、アイドルやってみないか？", "zh": "你要不要来当偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2001_018ele", "source_sha256": "525a842c73880b28b6399610980bfd93cf4ab50f68aead169b63ed140a7e3140", "ja": "アイドル？", "zh": "偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "58e2a6869c624ca5c545a809a6464edf2fb1e68b483e34eb7ca9732305d533cd", "ja": "そう。\n実は俺は、アイドルのプロデューサーをしてるんだ。", "zh": "对，其实我是偶像制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2003_018ele", "source_sha256": "a386c4f8c6e8077b2d557143e167f095d16daa5d923a26de55f6c4c474a7e49e", "ja": "アイドル……\nそれって、楽しいノ？", "zh": "偶像……\n那个好玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "dad29c7221203972cc21b334ee7ea1891ea7d6c8afe4b0761a3208ab9fabecfd", "ja": "ああ、きっと楽しいと思う！\n歌って踊って、みんなを笑顔にする仕事だから。", "zh": "嗯，我想一定会很好玩的！\n因为这是份透过唱歌跳舞，让大家绽放笑容的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2005_018ele", "source_sha256": "91df5044daa378bcd81a60f4c84dc1b5640dc2bfa23cc18143b84dcb5b7e6efd", "ja": "歌って踊って、みんなを笑顔に……。", "zh": "用唱歌跳舞，让大家绽放笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2006_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f10340d9f68829ec6eeebc62e68639b8e26fc7950de8c7cf7814af2cab4f9e5", "ja": "……ワオ！\nそれって、とってもステキだネ！？", "zh": "……哇！\n听起来很棒耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "eba3b2401534df0d2b27051fd57d356f94ee6a44a7be4da5108c918fbef83ddf", "ja": "踊るのが大好きな君に、ピッタリだと思うんだ。\nやってみないか？", "zh": "我觉得这很适合喜欢跳舞的你。\n你要不要试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2008_018ele", "source_sha256": "3188dc4f351d3c5cbbb2b2be05280a4538ea1111f1c0bfd86cd4d1f19ed037e2", "ja": "ワタシ、やってみたいナ！　\n歌って踊って笑顔にするお仕事、最高だヨ♪", "zh": "我想试试看！\n用唱歌跳舞让人绽放笑容的工作，太棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "808105afef0c0912deca48febdf1eeb0e6d8e576904580217ecc7d021a9e7a2a", "ja": "よかった。\nそれじゃあ、これからよろしく！　……えっと。", "zh": "太好了。\n那么，今后请多多指教……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2010_018ele", "source_sha256": "791acf2560af30273339ae5201d1b74fc79d08f9aa189a63c7381b984cb6715e", "ja": "島原エレナだヨ！　\nよろしくネ♪", "zh": "我是岛原艾琳娜唷！\n请多指教♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_018ele_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_018ele_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "3dd3bd1b81d52e35d0e98550c116a48d1aac2f030dbf614546f3f0b61255dd2c", "ja": "（弾けるような満面の笑み……この輝きがさらに\n増すように、しっかりプロデュースを頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（她脸上的笑容活力四射……\n为了能让这道光芒更加耀眼，我要努力培育她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
